            "expected": "all tests pass"
          },
          "status": "pending"
        },
        {
          "id": "subtask-1-3",
          "title": "Extend parser unit tests for spec coverage",
          "description": "In tests/test_phase3_parsers.py, add explicit tests for: (a) deep nested headings H2>H3>H4 with correct parent/is_leaf resolution; (b) links with descriptions in all separator styles (-, —, :) plus emphasis-wrapped titles; (c) non-link content: prose paragraphs, badge bullets, TOC anchors, back-to-top links, and nested sub-bullets under an item are excluded from items but do not shift heading_line/last_item_line indices; (d) bs4-extracted HTML links (from subtask 1-1) land under the correct category. Do not weaken existing tests.",
          "service": "backend",
          "files_to_modify": ["tests/test_phase3_parsers.py"],
          "files_to_create": [],
          "patterns_from": ["tests/test_phase3_parsers.py"],
          "verification": {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "cd /Users/nick/awesome-researcher && python -m pytest tests/test_phase3_parsers.py -q",
            "expected": "all tests pass"
          },
          "status": "pending"
        },
        {
          "id": "subtask-1-4",
          "title": "Full suite regression run",
          "description": "Run the complete pytest suite to confirm the parser changes (especially bs4 integration) did not regress the fetcher, renderer, or any other phase tests.",
          "service": "backend",
          "files_to_modify": [],
          "files_to_create": [],
          "patterns_from": [],
          "verification": {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "cd /Users/nick/awesome-researcher && python -m pytest tests/ -q",
            "expected": "all tests pass (or same pass set as before the change)"
          },
          "status": "pending"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "summary": {
